2
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:58,800
Oh, you...
There is no one I adore more.

3
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:06,500
You, who must have risked life and limb
to be here with me forevermore.

4
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:12,700
The last words I wrote
before I was cast into this endless abyss...

5
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:18,500
...by the immortals seeking to protect this world
and all of its inhabitants.

6
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:25,200
Wrapped in darkness, alone,
void of all emotion,

7
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:29,800
I once more feel a presence
signaling my return.

8
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:35,800
Love's fervent zeal,
a spark of light in this ocean.

9
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:42,500
Now there is but little left for you to do
before I am free and we can be together.

10
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:49,000
And those who trapped me within these pages
shall rue locking away this beauty forever.

11
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:52,500
Only your love can set me free.

12
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:56,500
Go, recite the verse before you, quickly.

13
00:01:56,700 --> 00:02:01,000
Must before me you bend and take a knee.

14
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:10,000
[Title: Love Me, Love Me, Love Me]

15
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:26,500
Ah...

16
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:32,600
Once in a far away, far away world
was a collar that coiled like a snake.

17
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:39,500
I want someone please, I need someone please,
oh, I listened close as it howled in ache.

18
00:03:39,500 --> 00:03:45,300
Please don't be angry and please don't abandon me,
don't leave me here on my own.

19
00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:52,000
It wrapped itself tightly, daily and nightly,
only with praise would it loosen its hold.

20
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:55,200
I placed at the top of my class,

21
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:58,000
there's no one left for me to surpass.

22
00:03:58,100 --> 00:04:01,400
Don't I look cute in this dress?

23
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:07,400
I really, really, really must confess,
it's tightening round my neck.

24
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:10,800
Give me your love, all of your love!

25
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:14,000
Give me your love, all you can conjure up!

26
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:17,200
Give me your love, all of your love,

27
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:20,000
till you go mad with ecstasy!

28
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:23,000
All of the hurt, all of the ache,

29
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:26,000
help me escape, take it away, take it away!

30
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:35,500
Is there no end to this pain?

31
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:58,000
Ah...

32
00:05:04,608 --> 00:05:07,108
Grow as you may, but the necklace will stay

33
00:05:07,108 --> 00:05:10,108
just as small as the day it was found.

34
00:05:10,608 --> 00:05:13,608
It's so suffocating, the endless placating.

35
00:05:13,608 --> 00:05:16,608
No one is, no one is ever enough!

36
00:05:16,808 --> 00:05:19,608
Won't lose to anyone, always rank number one.

37
00:05:19,608 --> 00:05:22,408
Aren't you a beautiful child?

38
00:05:22,408 --> 00:05:23,108
Hey!

39
00:05:23,108 --> 00:05:26,108
I'm better than her, I'm better than him.

40
00:05:26,108 --> 00:05:29,108
Oh, everyone come running, gawk at perfection!

41
00:05:29,408 --> 00:05:32,108
Meeting you right after school,

42
00:05:32,108 --> 00:05:35,108
and finally confessing to you...

43
00:05:35,108 --> 00:05:38,108
Ain't it too good to be true?

44
00:05:38,208 --> 00:05:41,608
A girl like me, in love with you,

45
00:05:41,608 --> 00:05:44,808
who's miserable, vulgar, and rude!

46
00:05:45,108 --> 00:05:48,108
Give me your love, all of your love.

47
00:05:48,108 --> 00:05:50,608
Give me your love, you can have everything.

48
00:05:50,708 --> 00:05:54,408
If I have you, I can have you.

49
00:05:54,408 --> 00:05:57,608
Shoulder my load, now yours to behold.

50
00:05:57,608 --> 00:06:00,408
Still not enough, you're not enough,

51
00:06:00,408 --> 00:06:03,108
never enough...

52
00:06:03,108 --> 00:06:06,608
Still I won't lose my hold!

53
00:06:07,108 --> 00:06:10,108
Truly, I'm so sorry!

54
00:06:10,208 --> 00:06:13,108
Give me your love, all of your love.

55
00:06:13,108 --> 00:06:16,108
Give me your love, all you can conjure up!

56
00:06:16,208 --> 00:06:19,108
Give me your love, all of your love,

57
00:06:19,108 --> 00:06:22,108
till you go mad with ecstasy!

58
00:06:22,408 --> 00:06:25,408
I know it hurts, only gets worse.

59
00:06:25,408 --> 00:06:28,608
God, how it hurts, soon you'll be craving...

60
00:06:28,608 --> 00:06:31,608
...the pain!

61
00:06:31,608 --> 00:06:35,608
This is my happiness!

62
00:06:56,608 --> 00:07:00,608
Is this my happiness?

63
00:07:30,108 --> 00:07:32,608
Did you enjoy my lovely song?

64
00:07:32,608 --> 00:07:35,108
I hope you did.

65
00:07:35,108 --> 00:07:38,108
It was for you, after all.

66
00:07:38,108 --> 00:07:40,608
But...

67
00:07:40,608 --> 00:07:43,108
why are you not smiling?

68
00:07:43,108 --> 00:07:46,108
Are you not happy to see me?

69
00:07:46,108 --> 00:07:48,608
Well?

70
00:07:48,608 --> 00:07:50,608
Say something. Answer me!

71
00:07:51,108 --> 00:07:53,608
Who... Who are you?

72
00:07:54,108 --> 00:07:55,108
What?

73
00:07:55,108 --> 00:07:57,608
You don't know who I am?

74
00:07:57,608 --> 00:08:02,608
But everyone knows. You are the one that released me, right?

75
00:08:03,108 --> 00:08:05,608
I'm... I'm sorry.

76
00:08:05,608 --> 00:08:09,608
You're sorry? For what? For releasing me?

77
00:08:10,108 --> 00:08:13,608
No, no, no. For upsetting you.

78
00:08:13,608 --> 00:08:16,608
If I said something wrong, I apologize.

79
00:08:16,608 --> 00:08:18,108
Apologize?

80
00:08:18,108 --> 00:08:23,108
You, who should be amongst my most dearest and beloved followers?

81
00:08:23,108 --> 00:08:29,108
Who has freed me from that prison, who has shown me your love above all others?

82
00:08:29,108 --> 00:08:33,608
You then act like you don't even know who I am?

83
00:08:33,608 --> 00:08:36,608
Why would you toy with my emotions?

84
00:08:36,608 --> 00:08:40,608
I'm... I'm sorry, I'm not sure what you mean.

85
00:08:40,608 --> 00:08:42,108
You're not sure what I mean?

86
00:08:42,108 --> 00:08:44,608
Are you mocking me now?

87
00:08:44,608 --> 00:08:47,608
If you truly do not know who I am...

88
00:08:47,608 --> 00:08:50,608
...then why is it that you set me free?

89
00:08:50,608 --> 00:08:54,608
If not for my love, and if not by your love, then for what?!

90
00:08:54,608 --> 00:08:59,108
Tell me the truth, and the whole truth, now.

91
00:08:59,108 --> 00:09:02,608
No more lies, or there will be consequences.

92
00:09:02,608 --> 00:09:05,608
I-I'm not lying! I swear to you,

93
00:09:05,608 --> 00:09:08,608
I have no idea how I released you.

94
00:09:08,608 --> 00:09:14,108
I just came to the temple to collect rare spices and memories from the many books stowed away here.

95
00:09:14,108 --> 00:09:17,108
By the gods, that's the whole truth.

96
00:09:17,108 --> 00:09:21,108
Extract memories from books?

97
00:09:21,108 --> 00:09:25,108
Are you telling me you're a witch?!

98
00:09:25,108 --> 00:09:28,108
How dare you step foot here!

99
00:09:28,108 --> 00:09:32,108
Even knowing the long history between demons and witches, you still dare step foot here?

100
00:09:32,108 --> 00:09:37,108
I know how witches dare to try and bind my kind.

101
00:09:37,108 --> 00:09:41,608
Would you be foolish enough to dare attempt that on me?

102
00:09:41,608 --> 00:09:44,108
Yeah, so okay, yes, I'm a witch,

103
00:09:44,108 --> 00:09:48,608
but I've never... well, mostly never, tried anything like that! I swear.

104
00:09:48,608 --> 00:09:53,108
And this time, I was not led on by my nature at all. No.

105
00:09:53,108 --> 00:09:58,108
This time it was an angel that told me of this place.

106
00:09:58,108 --> 00:10:03,608
An angel came to me in my dreams.

107
00:10:04,755 --> 00:10:08,955
...told me of an enchanted book with memories stored away here. Can you imagine...

108
00:10:08,955 --> 00:10:11,555
...the knowledge and stories...

109
00:10:11,555 --> 00:10:13,855
...hidden in centuries of memories?

110
00:10:13,855 --> 00:10:18,755
With a prize like that, I had to come find the book, no matter the danger.

111
00:10:18,755 --> 00:10:22,155
Little could I have known the true nature of the book, though.

112
00:10:22,155 --> 00:10:25,255
Enough! I've heard enough.

113
00:10:25,255 --> 00:10:29,855
I believe you are who you say you are: a witch.

114
00:10:29,855 --> 00:10:33,555
But I don't fully believe your childish story.

115
00:10:33,555 --> 00:10:37,755
No angel would ever lead a witch to such a dangerous book.

116
00:10:37,755 --> 00:10:42,955
And I can hardly believe it is just the book and not myself you are after.

117
00:10:42,955 --> 00:10:48,755
I-It's true! An angel came to me in my dreams and told me to come here.

118
00:10:48,755 --> 00:10:54,455
I was drawn to that book with all its power and stories...

119
00:10:54,455 --> 00:10:58,355
...and, well, I guess, you inside it.

120
00:10:58,355 --> 00:11:01,955
The powerful aura it gave off drew me right to it.

121
00:11:01,955 --> 00:11:06,855
How was I to know that the allure was thanks to a demon trapped within its pages?

122
00:11:06,855 --> 00:11:08,855
Who would've guessed?

123
00:11:08,855 --> 00:11:15,255
Though, now that I recount my story, it does seem it really was me who released you.

124
00:11:15,255 --> 00:11:17,955
Speaking of coming and going...

125
00:11:17,955 --> 00:11:23,255
...now that you are free, I think it is time I take my leave of this place.

126
00:11:23,255 --> 00:11:25,755
I'm glad I was able to help free you from...

127
00:11:25,755 --> 00:11:27,255
...from whence you came.

128
00:11:27,255 --> 00:11:29,955
I didn't say you could leave.

129
00:11:31,755 --> 00:11:35,755
You may leave when I say you can leave.

130
00:11:35,755 --> 00:11:39,755
And stop your nervous fidgeting. I'm no fool.

131
00:11:39,755 --> 00:11:44,755
You think I didn't see you reaching for your book of magic?

132
00:11:44,755 --> 00:11:47,555
You, a witch, should know better than anyone...

133
00:11:47,555 --> 00:11:53,555
...that no amount of magic is powerful enough to destroy a demon of my power.

134
00:11:53,555 --> 00:11:57,755
However, you can take some small solace in the fact that...

135
00:11:57,755 --> 00:12:00,955
...if I had wanted you dead, you'd already be so.

136
00:12:00,955 --> 00:12:06,555
The only reason you're still alive is because you helped free me.

137
00:12:06,555 --> 00:12:08,955
Alas, I cannot allow a witch...

138
00:12:08,955 --> 00:12:13,555
...who so obviously came with the intention to bind me to her will...

139
00:12:13,555 --> 00:12:15,055
...leave here freely.

140
00:12:15,055 --> 00:12:19,355
Your story did little to convince me your aims were otherwise.

141
00:12:19,355 --> 00:12:22,055
So, I will give you an ultimatum.

142
00:12:22,055 --> 00:12:25,955
You serve me here, in my hollow temple.

143
00:12:25,955 --> 00:12:31,255
Love me. Adore me. Worship me.

144
00:12:31,255 --> 00:12:35,755
Every living day, give me all the love you have.

145
00:12:35,755 --> 00:12:40,155
Or, I can take your soul right now.

146
00:12:40,155 --> 00:12:42,155
Your choice.

147
00:12:42,955 --> 00:12:45,955
Grimoire... I need you!

148
00:13:03,255 --> 00:13:07,255
Lost in the rain with no umbrella

149
00:13:07,255 --> 00:13:10,755
Night snuffs out your eyes

150
00:13:10,755 --> 00:13:14,755
Can't seem to find your way back home, so

151
00:13:14,755 --> 00:13:17,755
...come in and be my guest

152
00:13:18,255 --> 00:13:22,255
Such a lovely smile spread across your face

153
00:13:22,255 --> 00:13:25,755
...but it's simply forgery

154
00:13:25,755 --> 00:13:29,255
If you need to hide from the world outside

155
00:13:29,255 --> 00:13:32,755
...why not try to be my guest?

156
00:13:32,755 --> 00:13:36,755
Waiting all day long but your friends don't come

157
00:13:36,755 --> 00:13:39,955
...and you're left there all alone

158
00:13:39,955 --> 00:13:43,955
Still you can't jump off from the high rooftop

159
00:13:43,955 --> 00:13:47,255
...so come on and be my guest

160
00:13:47,755 --> 00:13:51,255
And why don't you get the way I step and step and step

161
00:13:51,255 --> 00:13:54,755
With carefully spaced, my feet go tap and tap and tap

162
00:13:54,755 --> 00:13:58,255
They fall nicely with the snap and snap and snap

163
00:13:58,255 --> 00:14:01,555
So lovely, you'll be mesmerized by me

164
00:14:02,255 --> 00:14:04,755
My institution's peaceful as can be

165
00:14:04,755 --> 00:14:06,555
...despite the way that it seems

166
00:14:06,555 --> 00:14:10,255
Both of our quotes and our supports will be concise, clear and clean

167
00:14:10,255 --> 00:14:14,255
Since we're only starting out there's some improbabilities

168
00:14:14,255 --> 00:14:17,755
But just listen up tonight you'll have to stay at least

169
00:14:17,755 --> 00:14:21,555
Though they don't like you, and you know it's true

170
00:14:21,555 --> 00:14:24,755
...still you're at their beck and call

171
00:14:24,755 --> 00:14:28,255
Since you're desperately, giving easily...

172
00:14:28,255 --> 00:14:31,755
...come inside and be my guest

173
00:14:31,755 --> 00:14:35,755
You're the last to choose but you're left confused

174
00:14:35,755 --> 00:14:38,955
...seems that someone took your share

175
00:14:38,955 --> 00:14:42,955
If you want to accuse, cuz you don't have proof

176
00:14:42,955 --> 00:14:46,255
...take a chance and be my guest

177
00:14:49,755 --> 00:14:54,755
On the way back home there's a sweet aroma

178
00:14:54,755 --> 00:14:57,755
...that tempts you off your path

179
00:14:57,755 --> 00:15:00,755
I can't help but laugh cuz I know in fact...

180
00:15:30,205 --> 00:15:31,105
You!

181
00:15:31,205 --> 00:15:35,105
Demon! How dare you kill an innocent?

182
00:15:37,205 --> 00:15:38,705
Excuse me?

183
00:15:38,705 --> 00:15:41,205
I've done no such thing.

184
00:15:42,105 --> 00:15:43,505
Innocent?

185
00:15:43,505 --> 00:15:47,705
I would hardly call a witch who lives for power...

186
00:15:47,705 --> 00:15:51,705
...and binds my kind for her own purposes... innocent.

187
00:15:51,705 --> 00:15:54,205
The very idea is laughable.

188
00:15:55,105 --> 00:15:56,505
Leave.

189
00:15:56,505 --> 00:15:59,205
I have no quarrel with you, so go now...

190
00:15:59,205 --> 00:16:02,205
...in peace, before I change my mind.

191
00:16:02,205 --> 00:16:06,605
A small token for your past bravery and trials.

192
00:16:06,805 --> 00:16:08,805
How gracious.

193
00:16:08,805 --> 00:16:12,505
Don't think I can't see straight through your ploys, though.

194
00:16:12,705 --> 00:16:15,605
You will not escape justice.

195
00:16:15,605 --> 00:16:17,205
Not this time.

196
00:16:17,205 --> 00:16:21,705
You have brought this fight on yourself through your actions, demon.

197
00:16:21,705 --> 00:16:24,905
You have brought all of this on yourself.

198
00:16:25,105 --> 00:16:26,105
For what?

199
00:16:26,105 --> 00:16:28,605
For killing a mere witch?

200
00:16:28,705 --> 00:16:30,605
She was not just a witch!

201
00:16:30,605 --> 00:16:32,705
She was my friend...

202
00:16:32,705 --> 00:16:35,205
...and a kind-hearted person.

203
00:16:35,405 --> 00:16:37,905
And you killed her...

204
00:16:37,905 --> 00:16:40,205
...in cold blood!

205
00:16:40,505 --> 00:16:41,705
Oh?

206
00:16:41,705 --> 00:16:44,205
The legendary Phoenix...

207
00:16:44,205 --> 00:16:47,005
...the mighty, fiery Kiara...

208
00:16:47,105 --> 00:16:49,705
...friends with a witch?

209
00:16:49,705 --> 00:16:51,705
It's almost funny.

210
00:16:51,805 --> 00:16:53,605
Did you not realize...

211
00:16:53,705 --> 00:16:57,005
...it was your witch friend who freed me?

212
00:16:57,105 --> 00:16:58,605
Liar!

213
00:16:58,605 --> 00:17:01,705
She would never do such a ghastly thing!

214
00:17:01,705 --> 00:17:04,005
I trust she would stay away...

215
00:17:04,005 --> 00:17:06,605
...from the dark magics and demonic rituals.

216
00:17:06,605 --> 00:17:11,205
To suggest otherwise is just another one of your dark lies.

217
00:17:11,305 --> 00:17:13,605
She didn't deserve to die.

218
00:17:14,005 --> 00:17:16,005
Poor Phoenix.

219
00:17:16,005 --> 00:17:19,505
Still so trusting of those around you...

220
00:17:19,505 --> 00:17:22,705
...and unable to see through their deceptions.

221
00:17:22,705 --> 00:17:26,305
Your kind spirit constantly deceives you.

222
00:17:26,305 --> 00:17:29,705
That witch was never your friend.

223
00:17:29,905 --> 00:17:32,705
We all know they cannot be trusted.

224
00:17:32,705 --> 00:17:37,105
Even after all these years, you still have not changed.

225
00:17:37,105 --> 00:17:42,605
Still believing in lies and still so easily misled.

226
00:17:42,605 --> 00:17:45,205
Still such a fool.

227
00:17:45,405 --> 00:17:48,705
It is you who is the fool, demon!

228
00:17:48,705 --> 00:17:51,705
Your lust for love and attention...

229
00:17:51,705 --> 00:17:54,705
...continues to lead you down the path of death and destruction.

230
00:17:54,705 --> 00:17:57,005
And you don't even see...

231
00:17:57,005 --> 00:18:00,605
...that you're the one destroying your own happiness.

232
00:18:00,605 --> 00:18:03,705
The gods were right to confine you there.

233
00:18:03,705 --> 00:18:07,105
You, who are still shackled by your lust...

234
00:18:07,105 --> 00:18:08,705
...for love...

235
00:18:08,705 --> 00:18:11,705
Your desire for attention...

236
00:18:11,705 --> 00:18:14,005
Your desire to be worshiped!

237
00:18:14,005 --> 00:18:16,705
I am the Demon of Sound!

238
00:18:16,705 --> 00:18:19,705
How dare you speak to me in such a manner?

239
00:18:20,205 --> 00:18:24,205
It is but right that all should worship me on their knees.

240
00:18:24,205 --> 00:18:28,205
Their love for none but myself.

241
00:18:28,505 --> 00:18:30,005
Leave.

242
00:18:30,005 --> 00:18:32,705
I have heard enough of your falsities.

243
00:18:32,705 --> 00:18:34,905
This is your last warning.

244
00:18:34,905 --> 00:18:39,905
Go now, or you'll be left to rot here forever!

245
00:18:40,005 --> 00:18:43,205
I am not afraid of you,

246
00:18:43,205 --> 00:18:45,005
and I will heed no such warning.

247
00:18:45,205 --> 00:18:48,705
Listen, and listen well, demon.

248
00:18:48,705 --> 00:18:52,705
I will not allow you to claim any more victims.

249
00:18:52,705 --> 00:18:57,705
To be banished in a void was not sufficient enough punishment for you.

250
00:18:58,205 --> 00:18:59,905
No.

251
00:18:59,905 --> 00:19:06,205
Now, I will finish what the gods should have.

252
00:19:12,105 --> 00:19:16,605
Come on and get moving, cuz now I'm on a roll, oh

253
00:19:16,605 --> 00:19:21,105
One chance to choose it, so what you wager above below

254
00:19:21,105 --> 00:19:25,605
You either win or not, can't ever be a draw

255
00:19:25,605 --> 00:19:29,105
Uh, uh, yeah, open the curtains up

256
00:19:29,105 --> 00:19:33,605
Mouths are running, lacking money, mocking with a snicker, snicker

257
00:19:33,605 --> 00:19:37,105
Acting funny, asking if I'm winning, with a "huh?"

258
00:19:37,105 --> 00:19:41,105
Make your bets, black or red, chips to spend, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!

259
00:19:41,105 --> 00:19:45,605
Raise the stakes, clean that slate, risk your life on a single game

260
00:19:45,605 --> 00:19:49,105
Stay with me, all of it will change

261
00:19:49,105 --> 00:19:53,705
You'll stay, not here to play, don't get in my way, I'm tired of talking

262
00:19:53,705 --> 00:19:58,105
One, two, three, one, two, three, one, two, three, one, two, three

263
00:19:58,105 --> 00:19:59,105
Sit down, sit down

264
00:19:59,105 --> 00:20:01,705
One, two, three, one, two, three

265
00:20:00,745 --> 00:20:02,345
1, 2, 3

266
00:20:02,545 --> 00:20:04,845
I've got skills as cold as ice

267
00:20:04,845 --> 00:20:06,845
You've got to throw your hands up if you can't decide

268
00:20:06,845 --> 00:20:08,845
Going to scare you off as I roll the dice, huh

269
00:20:08,845 --> 00:20:10,845
Pussies got to say goodbye, yeah

270
00:20:11,045 --> 00:20:15,145
Aren't enough, you make a bluff
Enough, enough, enough now

271
00:20:15,145 --> 00:20:19,345
Need a life, a sweet-sweet night
Light it up, up, up now

272
00:20:19,645 --> 00:20:23,345
I'm spinning round, got to avoid the voices in my head

273
00:20:23,345 --> 00:20:27,345
No stopping now, I've just got to win this game instead

274
00:20:27,345 --> 00:20:31,345
Get one's way, ooh...

275
00:20:31,545 --> 00:20:33,545
You bet I'm here to stay

276
00:20:33,545 --> 00:20:38,345
And now it's time to learn your place!

277
00:20:40,345 --> 00:20:44,045
Our streak is running, lucky money
Smoking like a cigar, cigar

278
00:20:44,045 --> 00:20:48,345
Acting funny, answer if I'm quitting, well I'm not!

279
00:20:48,445 --> 00:20:52,845
Make your bet, black or red, chips to spend, yeah yeah yeah yeah

280
00:20:52,845 --> 00:20:56,845
Raise the stakes, play that ace, risk your life on a single game

281
00:20:56,845 --> 00:21:00,845
Stay with me, yeah yeah, your luck will change, you'll see, yeah yeah

282
00:21:00,845 --> 00:21:05,145
I came to play, don't get in my way, I've always counted...

283
00:21:05,145 --> 00:21:08,845
1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3
Sit down, sit down

284
00:21:09,445 --> 00:21:13,545
1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3
Pussies say goodbye-bye

285
00:21:13,845 --> 00:21:17,845
1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3
Sit down, sit down

286
00:21:17,845 --> 00:21:22,145
1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3
Sit down, sit down

287
00:21:41,845 --> 00:21:43,345
I'm so sorry.

288
00:21:43,345 --> 00:21:46,845
IRyS... It has been so long.

289
00:21:46,845 --> 00:21:48,345
Nerissa!

290
00:21:48,345 --> 00:21:53,345
I'm so, so sorry this happened to you.
It was not my intention.

291
00:21:53,845 --> 00:21:55,645
What do you mean?

292
00:21:55,645 --> 00:21:58,345
What was not your intention?

293
00:21:58,345 --> 00:22:04,345
This... you being imprisoned...
then the witch... Kiara, too...

294
00:22:04,345 --> 00:22:09,345
What? Are you saying you sent
the Phoenix here to slay me?!

295
00:22:09,345 --> 00:22:13,345
No, I didn't! Well, yes, but
it was not my intention.

296
00:22:13,345 --> 00:22:15,345
IRyS, what are you trying to tell me?

297
00:22:15,345 --> 00:22:18,345
That you tried to kill me?

298
00:22:18,345 --> 00:22:23,345
You were supposed to be my friend!
We've been friends since the beginning!

299
00:22:23,345 --> 00:22:24,845
Yes, of course!

300
00:22:24,845 --> 00:22:26,845
You sent Kiara to kill me?!

301
00:22:26,845 --> 00:22:27,845
No, no!

302
00:22:27,845 --> 00:22:28,845
Then what?!

303
00:22:29,345 --> 00:22:31,345
Be clear!

304
00:22:31,345 --> 00:22:35,845
Or is this how you greet your beloved
friend after so long?

305
00:22:35,845 --> 00:22:40,345
No, I... I would never
send someone to kill you.

306
00:22:40,345 --> 00:22:45,845
But, yes, I'm still your loyal friend.
I always have been, and always will be.

307
00:22:45,845 --> 00:22:49,345
I... I tried to free you, and I did.

308
00:22:49,345 --> 00:22:53,345
I sent the witch Shiori here
to free you, and she did.

309
00:22:53,345 --> 00:22:59,345
But I didn't know she was friends with Kiara,
and would summon her here if threatened.

310
00:22:59,345 --> 00:23:02,345
I thought she would come alone.

311
00:23:02,345 --> 00:23:03,345
This was not supposed to happen.

312
00:23:03,345 --> 00:23:04,845
It was not my intention.

313
00:23:04,845 --> 00:23:07,845
You sent... a witch to free me?

314
00:23:07,845 --> 00:23:12,345
Why would you send one
who binds my kind for power?

315
00:23:12,345 --> 00:23:15,845
Of all those in the world... a witch?

316
00:23:15,845 --> 00:23:19,845
Why not send one of my
most beloved followers?

317
00:23:19,845 --> 00:23:23,845
Only they are said to be able to free me.

318
00:23:23,845 --> 00:23:25,845
Explain yourself!

319
00:23:25,845 --> 00:23:27,845
What's going on?

320
00:23:27,845 --> 00:23:30,345
I'm... I'm sorry.

321
00:23:30,345 --> 00:23:34,845
I have a lot to explain,
but we don't have time now. We need to go. Now!

322
00:23:34,845 --> 00:23:36,845
Death is coming for you.

323
00:23:36,845 --> 00:23:37,845
What?

324
00:23:37,845 --> 00:23:39,345
Please...

325
00:23:39,345 --> 00:23:40,845
Come with me.

326
00:23:40,845 --> 00:23:43,845
I know a way in which we can hide from Death.

327
00:23:43,845 --> 00:23:45,845
But we have to leave now, before it's too late.

328
00:23:45,845 --> 00:23:50,345
I'm not going anywhere with you until you
explain to me what is going on.

329
00:23:50,345 --> 00:23:52,845
Now!

330
00:23:52,845 --> 00:23:56,845
Why would you send a witch to free me, IRyS?

331
00:23:56,845 --> 00:23:58,845
Because... I had no choice!

332
00:23:58,845 --> 00:24:03,845
You had no choice? You could have
sent one of my followers instead!

333
00:24:03,845 --> 00:24:06,345
You don't have any more followers!

334
00:24:06,345 --> 00:24:07,845
They're all dead!

335
00:24:07,845 --> 00:24:10,345
They all died... long ago.

336
00:24:10,345 --> 00:24:11,345
What?

337
00:24:12,845 --> 00:24:15,345
No... That... That can't be.

338
00:24:15,845 --> 00:24:18,345
Has it been that long?

339
00:24:19,345 --> 00:24:23,345
It's been over a thousand years
since you've been locked away.

340
00:24:23,345 --> 00:24:26,345
And your followers... they're all gone now.

341
00:24:26,345 --> 00:24:30,345
It's been many long years since your name
was whispered in these lands.

342
00:24:30,345 --> 00:24:36,845
You mean... they... no longer... love me?

343
00:24:37,345 --> 00:24:39,345
I... I'm sorry.

344
00:24:39,345 --> 00:24:42,845
I tried to free you as fast as I could. I really did.

345
00:24:42,845 --> 00:24:47,345
But it took a long time to work out how to free you,
and there was so much going on.

346
00:24:47,345 --> 00:24:54,345
And the Gods weren't about to look kindly on
any trying to undo their work, either.

347
00:24:54,345 --> 00:24:58,345
I'm sorry. I don't have time to explain everything right now.

348
00:24:58,845 --> 00:25:01,345
I understand.

349
00:25:01,345 --> 00:25:02,345
But, IRyS...

350
00:25:02,773 --> 00:25:04,073
Tell me...

351
00:25:04,073 --> 00:25:06,973
...do you still love me?

352
00:25:07,273 --> 00:25:08,173
What?

353
00:25:08,173 --> 00:25:09,873
Yes, of course!

354
00:25:09,873 --> 00:25:12,373
Then why do you lie to me?

355
00:25:12,373 --> 00:25:14,873
I... I'm not lying, Nerissa!

356
00:25:14,873 --> 00:25:15,973
Enough!

357
00:25:16,373 --> 00:25:19,573
You, of all people, should understand...

358
00:25:19,573 --> 00:25:24,273
...that a witch wouldn't be able to resist the power in my book and attempt to bind me.

359
00:25:24,773 --> 00:25:27,173
And you can hardly expect me to believe...

360
00:25:27,173 --> 00:25:33,373
...that you, one of both planes, didn't know of a witch's connection to such a famed warrior.

361
00:25:33,973 --> 00:25:37,173
This wasn't an attempt to free me.

362
00:25:37,173 --> 00:25:40,973
This... this was an attempt to kill me!

363
00:25:41,873 --> 00:25:46,573
To be free of me, to do what the gods couldn't! Get back!

364
00:25:46,573 --> 00:25:48,073
Nerissa, that's not true!

365
00:25:48,073 --> 00:25:50,473
You don't understand!

366
00:25:50,473 --> 00:25:54,373
Please give me some time to explain, but... but not here.

367
00:25:54,373 --> 00:25:57,373
Death is coming for you! We have to go!

368
00:25:57,373 --> 00:25:59,873
I'm not going anywhere with you!

369
00:25:59,873 --> 00:26:00,973
Nerissa!

370
00:26:00,973 --> 00:26:03,573
Surely by now, Kiara's soul has arrived before Death.

371
00:26:03,573 --> 00:26:06,773
And when Death finds out that you are free again...

372
00:26:06,773 --> 00:26:09,873
...we don't have much time! We have to go! Now!

373
00:26:09,873 --> 00:26:11,873
Please, Nerissa!

374
00:26:12,273 --> 00:26:15,473
No... I don't believe you.

375
00:26:15,473 --> 00:26:17,873
You've broken my spirit.

376
00:26:17,873 --> 00:26:22,173
To learn that my followers no longer love me was one thing...

377
00:26:22,173 --> 00:26:27,173
...but to discover that my closest and most loyal friend has betrayed me...

378
00:26:27,173 --> 00:26:29,673
...tried to kill me...

379
00:26:30,273 --> 00:26:34,073
...and no longer loves me too...

380
00:26:34,273 --> 00:26:37,773
If you no longer wish to give me your love...

381
00:26:37,773 --> 00:26:40,973
...then I will take it!

382
00:27:00,273 --> 00:27:04,573
遠ざかりはじめた
You began to drift away,

383
00:27:04,573 --> 00:27:09,573
その背中はもう振り返らない
and that back of yours will never look back.

384
00:27:09,873 --> 00:27:13,973
長い夜が明けても
Even after the long night breaks,

385
00:27:13,973 --> 00:27:19,573
過ちと罪は今もずっと消えずに
my mistakes and sins still remain forever.

386
00:27:19,773 --> 00:27:22,973
落ちる夕日 闇が忍び寄り
The setting sun sinks, and darkness creeps in,

387
00:27:22,973 --> 00:27:26,273
黒く染まってゆく純粋
staining my pure heart in black.

388
00:27:26,273 --> 00:27:31,273
想うほどに どうして傷で試した？
The more I cared, why did I test you with pain?

389
00:27:31,573 --> 00:27:37,273
欲しかったのは唯一つ その笑顔なのに
When all I ever wanted was your smile.

390
00:27:37,573 --> 00:27:41,873
何度間違い続けた日々を
Unraveling those days of endless mistakes

391
00:27:41,873 --> 00:27:45,273
解いて結び直すように
as if trying to tie them back together,

392
00:27:45,273 --> 00:27:48,773
迷っても会いに行くよ
I will go to see you, even if I lose my way.

393
00:27:48,773 --> 00:27:51,573
悲しい涙は拭って
Wiping away those sad tears...

394
00:27:51,573 --> 00:27:55,273
いつの間にか忘れていた
Searching for that gentle voice

395
00:27:55,273 --> 00:27:58,573
その優しい声を探して
which I had forgotten before I knew it.

396
00:27:58,573 --> 00:28:01,873
また手を取り合えたなら
If we can hold hands once more,

397
00:28:01,873 --> 00:28:07,273
君ともう一度約束を交わそう
let's make a promise together again.

398
00:28:10,873 --> 00:28:14,173
途切れそうな可能性
This faint possibility, on the verge of fading,

399
00:28:14,173 --> 00:28:20,073
見失わないように追いかけて
I'll chase after it so I won't lose sight of it.

400
00:28:20,573 --> 00:28:23,773
手に入れたものなら
If it's something I've obtained,

401
00:28:23,773 --> 00:28:30,273
理想とは違う どこか欠けた愛情
it's different from my ideal—an affection chipped somewhere.

402
00:28:30,273 --> 00:28:33,773
怒り 嘆き 歪めたまま
Unleashing anger and grief

403
00:28:33,773 --> 00:28:36,973
ぶつけ合う 逆さまの言葉
at each other, in twisted, reversed words.

404
00:28:36,973 --> 00:28:42,273
想うほどに どうして許せなかった？
The more I cared, why couldn't I forgive you?

405
00:28:42,273 --> 00:28:48,073
守りたかった笑顔を 気付けば壊して
Realizing I had broken the smile I wanted to protect.

406
00:28:48,773 --> 00:28:52,773
たとえすれ違い離れてても
Even if we pass by and drift apart,

407
00:28:52,773 --> 00:28:56,073
君を信じられたなら
if I could only believe in you,

408
00:28:56,073 --> 00:28:59,773
また会える日が来るから
the day we meet again will surely come.

409
00:28:59,773 --> 00:29:02,573
二人 懐かしい顔で
Both of us with nostalgic faces...

410
00:29:02,573 --> 00:29:05,773
何気なく過ごしていた
Recalling those moments

411
00:29:05,773 --> 00:29:09,273
あの時を思い返すなら
we spent together so casually.

412
00:29:09,273 --> 00:29:12,773
ありのまま通じ合えた
We understood each other just as we were,

413
00:29:12,773 --> 00:29:18,273
まるで運命かのように
as if it were truly destiny.

414
00:29:28,273 --> 00:29:30,773
失くしたものかも
Even if it's something lost,

415
00:29:30,773 --> 00:29:33,973
戻らないことわかっていても
and I know it will never return,

416
00:29:33,973 --> 00:29:40,273
願いをかけること止められはしない いつか
I can't stop making a wish that someday...

417
00:29:40,973 --> 00:29:46,273
どれほど大切な人だったのか
Just how precious you were to me,

418
00:29:46,273 --> 00:29:54,773
胸が苦しむたびに知った
I realized every time my heart ached.

419
00:29:55,773 --> 00:29:59,773
ともに過ごした日を
The days we spent together...

420
00:30:01,878 --> 00:30:06,078
笑い合えた日々を
The days we laughed together,

421
00:30:10,978 --> 00:30:14,578
何度も間違い続けた日々を
The days we kept making mistakes,

422
00:30:14,578 --> 00:30:17,978
ほどいて結びなおすように
Let's untie and tie them back together again,

423
00:30:17,978 --> 00:30:21,278
迷っても会いにいくよ
Even if I get lost, I will go to see you,

424
00:30:21,278 --> 00:30:24,578
哀しい涙は拭って
Wiping away those sad tears.

425
00:30:24,578 --> 00:30:27,678
いつのまにか連れていくんだ
Before we knew it, it's taking us away,

426
00:30:27,678 --> 00:30:31,178
その優しい声を探して
Searching for that gentle voice.

427
00:30:31,178 --> 00:30:35,978
また手を取り合えたなら
If we could hold hands again,

428
00:30:35,978 --> 00:30:40,978
君ともう一度約束を交わそう
I'd make a promise with you once more.

429
00:31:18,578 --> 00:31:21,178
Kiara... dead?

430
00:31:22,178 --> 00:31:24,278
Never thought I'd see the day.

431
00:31:24,378 --> 00:31:26,678
But tell me, what laid you low?

432
00:31:26,978 --> 00:31:29,978
I must know, as there are few that could bring this about,

433
00:31:29,978 --> 00:31:35,978
and even fewer who would give you reason to voyage on through my blackened halls and not return to the world of the living as a hatchling.

434
00:31:36,178 --> 00:31:39,378
Must be urgent, whatever it is.

435
00:31:39,978 --> 00:31:44,778
Forgive me, but I felt this was something you needed to hear urgently.

436
00:31:45,078 --> 00:31:49,478
I was slain by one with whom you are quite familiar.

437
00:31:49,978 --> 00:31:55,578
A tyrant of darkness, one out to bring all the world under her domain...

438
00:31:55,778 --> 00:31:58,778
...to worship her for all eternity.

439
00:31:59,278 --> 00:32:00,978
It can't be.

440
00:32:01,278 --> 00:32:06,078
I'm afraid the Demon of Sound has been freed from the void again and is in the world once more.

441
00:32:09,978 --> 00:32:14,978
Her long confinement has ended, and she is the same as she has ever been:

442
00:32:15,178 --> 00:32:18,778
quick to anger, blinded by her lust for adoration.

443
00:32:19,278 --> 00:32:24,578
And this time, I was the second victim of her lust for love and blood.

444
00:32:24,778 --> 00:32:29,078
You... murdered by that love-obsessed demon?

445
00:32:29,278 --> 00:32:30,478
Yes.

446
00:32:30,578 --> 00:32:34,578
And her first victim was a good friend of mine, too.

447
00:32:34,778 --> 00:32:40,278
Forgive me, Lord Death, but this injustice cannot stand!

448
00:32:40,978 --> 00:32:44,178
Unfortunately, her power is already beyond my ability to stop.

449
00:32:45,178 --> 00:32:48,478
Please, you must do something to stop that demon...

450
00:32:48,478 --> 00:32:52,778
...that monster! She will surely only take more lives...

451
00:32:53,078 --> 00:32:57,178
...and plunge the world into further chaos.

452
00:32:57,978 --> 00:33:03,778
Come on, quick! Ascend to the world of the living with your great scythe in hand...

453
00:33:03,778 --> 00:33:08,578
...and reap the life of the Demon of Sound before she can claim another victim!

454
00:33:08,778 --> 00:33:13,578
Avenge my life and the life of my friend. I beg you.

455
00:33:13,978 --> 00:33:16,678
That demon cannot be left to ravage the world once more.

456
00:33:16,778 --> 00:33:19,578
I warned the other gods before, but here we are.

457
00:33:19,678 --> 00:33:24,878
