458
00:33:39,378 --> 00:33:42,678
Your demonic side was always to be the death of you, IRyS.

459
00:33:42,778 --> 00:33:44,878
Don't you dare speak her name.

460
00:33:44,978 --> 00:33:45,878
Silence!

461
00:33:46,178 --> 00:33:50,178
Your bloodlust and desire for adoration has clouded your judgment...

462
00:33:50,178 --> 00:33:53,178
