463
00:33:53,178 --> 00:33:56,878
You're the one who brought bloody doom upon your own beloved friend...

464
00:33:56,978 --> 00:33:59,078
...and yourself.

465
00:33:59,178 --> 00:34:04,678
Your fear of losing your hold over things brings about the very result you so fear.

466
00:34:04,978 --> 00:34:06,278
How dare you!

467
00:34:06,478 --> 00:34:11,178
