468
00:34:11,278 --> 00:34:16,678
In the end, you have only yourself to blame for the situation you find yourself in.

469
00:34:16,978 --> 00:34:22,178
A lust for love so strong, that those you love turn away.

470
00:34:22,578 --> 00:34:25,578
